msgid "Node.js: fs-extra"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/fs-extra_README.md:4
msgid ""
"`fs-extra` adds file system methods that aren't included in the native "
"`fs` module and adds promise support to the `fs` methods. It also uses "
"[`graceful-fs`](https://github.com/isaacs/node-graceful-fs) to prevent "
"`EMFILE` errors. It should be a drop in replacement for `fs`."
msgstr ""

